raw_text = "~ start
Marlow: [[Good to see you again|There you are|Welcome back]].
Marlow: This is the third island. Same soil, same seed. Different trouble.
Marlow: Here is your kit. The spray is new, so take that as well.
do GameDialogueManager.action_give_crop_seeds()
Marlow: Caterpillars. They find a crop within a few days, and they will not leave on their own.
- How do I get rid of them?
	Marlow: You will see one sitting on the plant. That is your warning.
	Marlow: Take the spray, click the plant, and it is gone. One click.
	Marlow: Spraying costs you nothing. Leaving a pest there costs you weight at harvest.
	Teemo: So check the plants, not the calendar.
	Marlow: Now you are farming.
- I have dealt with them before
	Teemo: I know a caterpillar when I see one.
=> END
"
metadata/dialogue_manager_version = "2.44.0"
